# Cursor-only skills (no re-bloat)

Brianna uses **Cursor only** (not Claude Code, Codex, OpenClaw, etc.). Duplicate skill catalogs waste ~80k+ tokens per chat.

## gstack setup — never multi-host

- **Never** run `./setup --host auto` or install for codex/factory/opencode/kiro/hermes/gbrain/slate.
- **Only** upgrade/reinstall with:
  ```bash
  ~/.claude/skills/gstack/setup-cursor-only.sh
  ```
  or `./setup --host claude` then immediately run `~/.claude/skills/dedup-gstack-skills-for-cursor.sh`.

## After any gstack setup or upgrade

Run dedup and confirm count stays low:

```bash
~/.claude/skills/dedup-gstack-skills-for-cursor.sh
find ~/.claude/skills -name SKILL.md | wc -l   # expect ~60, not 500+
```

## What must NOT come back

- `gstack/.agents`, `.cursor`, `.factory`, `.gbrain`, `.hermes`, `.kiro`, `.openclaw`, `.opencode`, `.slate`
- Top-level symlink dirs at `~/.claude/skills/qa`, `browse`, etc. (canonical paths: `gstack/qa/SKILL.md`, …)
- `gstack/openclaw/skills/` copies

Keep: `~/.claude/skills/gstack/*/SKILL.md`, plus `prd/` and `ralph-snarktank/`.

## Cursor plugins (skill catalog)

Prefer minimal plugin skills. **Disable** unless actively needed (Cursor Settings → Plugins):

- **Superpowers** (~14 skills) — disable if not using brainstorming/TDD workflows
- **Stripe** (~3 skills) — disable unless editing Stripe integration

**Keep Vercel plugin** for Illuminairy deploy/Next.js work. Do not suggest enabling extra plugin packs without a concrete task.

## Agent behavior

- Do not recreate multi-host gstack dirs or top-level skill symlinks.
- If asked to upgrade gstack, use `setup-cursor-only.sh` and verify dedup.
- Reference: `~/.claude/skills/README-cursor-dedup.md`
